      "source": "citation",
      "value": "2025-05-10",
      "detail": "https://littletonma.org/1287/Elections---2025",
      "quote": "View status of the Littleton Town Election - May 10, 2025",
      "note": "Littleton keeps one election page per year, an unbroken series from 2017 to 2026, so the 2025 page is the towns own answer for 2025. The results PDF we hold (DocumentCenter 9564) prints only the tally table with no date, which is why the gate could not date it; the same page links it as See the Results: Annual Town Election - May 10th, 2025, and the specimen ballot is filed as May-10-2025-BALLOT-SAMPLE. The same page separately lists a Littleton Special Town Election - November 1, 2025, which is a SPECIAL and is deliberately not allowed into this annual town-year slot."
    }
